            "notes": "this is where we change up the entire build, since [Righteous Cleave](item_fa98450c-b553-431d-997a-60fe2b0abb51) is a strong burst heal when paired with CDR and [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7), we use it to brawl tanks even when they get their damage increase at this round.\n\n\ntry not to play in front of a zarya, her bubbles stop you from getting the healing so you need to watch out to not waste both abilities (and in turn both cleave procs) on bubbles.\n\nalways get [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) and [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) as your purples.",
